{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10097","headline":"近获风痹之疾题寄所怀 · 包佶","name":"近获风痹之疾题寄所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病夫将已矣，无可答君恩。\n衾枕同羇客，图书委外孙。\n久来从吏道，常欲奉空门。\n疾走机先息，攲行力渐烦。\n无医能却老，有变是游魂。\n鸟宿还依伴，蓬飘莫问根。\n寓形齐指马，观境制心猨。\n唯借南荣地，清晨暂负喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}